article: Tomato Soup
drafted: 2024-11-02
published: 2024-11-20


  A simple soup for cold nights. This post has no author line, so the
  author comes from site.conf.

Ingredients

   -  2 lb tomatoes
   -  1 onion
   -  3 cloves garlic
   -  2 cups stock
   -  salt and pepper

Steps

   1. Roast the tomatoes, onion and garlic at 425F for 40 minutes.

   2. Put everything in a pot with the stock. Simmer for 15 minutes.

   3. Blend until smooth. Add salt and pepper to taste.

  // TODO: add a photo once the img: block renders.
  Serve with grilled cheese.
